<title>USA: Leucadia National extends conversion right.</title>
<headline>Leucadia National extends conversion right.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leucadia National Corp said it is extending through May 12, 1997 the time when holders of its outstanding 5-1/4 convertible subordinated debentures due 2003 may convert the debentures into Leucadia common shares, par value $1.00 per share, because it is in discussions for the sale of certain of its insurance operations.</p>
</text>
